  "summary": "Versatile IT Leader & Senior Engineer with over 20 years of experience bridging the gap between high-level technology strategy and hands-on technical execution. My career spans diverse, critical roles—including Systems Architect / Infrastructure Engineer, Senior Full-Stack Developer, Database Administrator (DBA), and IT Operations Manager allowing me to approach technical challenges with a unique perspective.  \n\nThroughout my career, I have specialized in architecting resilient multi-site networks and enterprise storage clusters, developing mission-critical full-stack web applications, and engineering high-performance data pipelines. \n\nWhether leading complex enterprise infrastructure overhauls from the ground up or optimizing deep PL/SQL and T-SQL database configurations, my core focus remains on delivering high availability, and absolute data integrity.  \n\nAs a technical leader, I thrive on aligning engineering practices with stringent governance protocols, maintaining flawless compliance with rigorous regulatory frameworks such as FDA 21 CFR Part 11 and CMMC. I am passionate about mentoring cross-functional technical talent, accelerating development workflows with modern tools like Cursor AI, and driving strategic IT operations that protect business continuity while fueling technological innovation.",
